This repository is an Expo / React Native adaptation of two MIT-licensed
works. It does not claim their authors wrote the Expo port.

- SwiftUI Expert Skill — Copyright (c) 2026 Antoine van der Lee.
  Source: https://github.com/AvdLee/SwiftUI-Agent-Skill
  The state, composition, layout, performance, list, navigation, animation,
